  <ModelVersion>6.0.0</ModelVersion>
  <ModelName>Resend on collision</ModelName>
  <ModelDescription>In this model, a packet source generates data packets at random times to
be transmitted (in reality, there would be multiple independent sources).
If two packets occupy the transmission medium at the same time, neither
can be received correctly. No successful acknowledgment is received, and
the source initiates another transmission attempt after a random amount
of time. However, after several unsuccessful attempts, the packet is
discarded.</ModelDescription>
